    title: "Medicare Lead Generation: The Complete Guide",
    metaTitle: "Medicare Lead Generation: The Complete Guide",
    excerpt: "A complete, foundational guide to Medicare lead generation for insurance agents.",
    metaDescription: "A complete, foundational guide to Medicare lead generation, covering the major sourcing channels agents use to find prospects and how to judge lead quality.",
    category: "Medicare Leads",
