    title: "Medicare Lead Generation Best Practices for 2026",
    metaTitle: "Medicare Lead Generation Best Practices 2026",
    excerpt: "A tactical checklist of current Medicare lead generation best practices for 2026.",
    metaDescription: "A tactical checklist of Medicare lead generation best practices for 2026, covering channel selection, follow-up speed, and compliance steps agents overlook.",
